 University and Green House announcements for current details.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"slu-bacheller-memorial-chime","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Bacheller Memorial Chime","title":"Pause for the weekday chime","subtitle":"Campus bell-ringing tradition","notes":"Listen near campus at 5 p.m. on an academic-year weekday for the Bacheller Memorial Chime, donated by alumnus and author Irving Bacheller.","short_summary":"A 1926 chime continues to ring on academic-year weekdays at 5 p.m.","evidence_claim":"St. Lawrence’s history states that the Bacheller Memorial Chime was donated in 1926 and that its bells ring every weekday during the academic year at 5 p.m.","source_url":"https://www.stlawu.edu/about/mission-and-history","source_title":"Mission and History | St. Lawrence University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The University states the bells ring on academic-year weekdays at 5 p.m.; schedules may vary during breaks.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
